    <description><![CDATA[
The Sendmux CLI provides command-line access to Sendmux Management, Mailbox, and Sending API surfaces.

Use it to manage domains, mailboxes, webhooks, logs, metrics, mailbox messages, and sending operations from Windows terminals and automation.

After installation, run:

```
sendmux --help
```

Documentation: https://docs.sendmux.ai
Source: https://github.com/Sendmux/sendmux-sdk
